56-77: Security manager is conditionally initialized; consider a separate availability flag

Tying security_manager initialization strictly to HEALTH_AVAILABLE is workable if both modules always ship together, but it also means any ImportError in the health module disables security auditing entirely.

If you intend security to be independently optional, consider a separate SECURITY_AVAILABLE flag and a separate import try for security. If health and security are tightly coupled by design, a short comment explaining that coupling would help future maintainers.

